```

**Sigurnost:**
- Auth obavezan (`requireAuthenticatedUser`) — sprečava da bilo ko koristi proxy
- URL validacija — samo `https://res.cloudinary.com/` dozvoljen (SSRF zaštita)
- `Content-Disposition: attachment` — browser **uvek** skida fajl, nikad ne otvara inline

---

### 2. `lib/utils.js` — `downloadFileToDevice` koristi proxy

Menja se `fetch(url)` → `fetch("/api/download?url=...&name=...")`:

```js
export async function downloadFileToDevice(url, name) {
  try {
    const proxyUrl = `/api/download?url=${encodeURIComponent(url)}&name=${encodeURIComponent(name || "download")}`;
    // Use a simple <a> click with the proxy URL.
    // The proxy sends Content-Disposition: attachment so the browser saves the
    // file. No fetch→blob→createObjectURL needed — that was the CORS workaround.
    const a = document.createElement("a");
    a.href = proxyUrl;
    a.download = ""; // hint browser, but server's Content-Disposition wins
    document.body.appendChild(a);
    a.click();
    a.remove();
  } catch {
    // Absolute last resort: open directly (won't work for Cloudinary PDFs,
    // but at least the user sees something rather than nothing)
    window.open(url, "_blank", "noopener,noreferrer");
  }
}
```

---

### 3. `components/chat/MessageComposer.jsx` — prošireni tipovi fajlova

Trenutno (linija ~105):
```js
const allowed =
  file.type.startsWith("image/") || file.type === "application/pdf";
```

Novi kod:
```js
// Allowed MIME types + extension fallback (some OS/browsers don't report
// MIME for .doc/.docx/.txt, so also check the file name).
const ALLOWED_MIMES = [
  "image/",
  "application/pdf",
  "application/msword",                                                      // .doc
  "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", // .docx
  "text/plain",                                                              // .txt
];
const ALLOWED_EXTENSIONS = [".pdf", ".doc", ".docx", ".txt"];
const ext = file.name.slice(file.name.lastIndexOf(".")).toLowerCase();
const allowed = 
  ALLOWED_MIMES.some((m) => file.type.startsWith(m) || file.type === m) ||
  ALLOWED_EXTENSIONS.includes(ext);
```

Takođe, potrebno je promeniti `accept` atribut na `<input type="file">`:
```jsx
accept="image/*,.pdf,.doc,.docx,.txt,application/pdf,application/msword,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document,text/plain"
```

I MIME-type za `uploadAttachment` — dodati mapiranje ekstenzije u `type` kad browser ne pošalje MIME:
```js
// After validation, before upload:
let uploadType = file.type.startsWith("image/") ? "image" : "pdf";
if (!file.type || file.type === "") {
  // Fallback: derive type from extension when MIME is empty
  const ext2 = file.name.slice(file.name.lastIndexOf(".")).toLowerCase();
  if (ext2 === ".txt") uploadType = "txt";
  else if (ext2 === ".doc" || ext2 === ".docx") uploadType = "doc";
  else if (ext2 === ".pdf") uploadType = "pdf";
}
```

