// File types the composer accepts from the OS file picker.
// MIME is checked first (works on desktop); the extension fallback catches
// cases where the browser doesn't report a MIME (common on mobile, or for
// .doc / .docx on some OS configurations).
const ALLOWED_FILE_EXTENSIONS = [".pdf", ".doc", ".docx", ".txt"];
```

**(b)** Zameni `handleFiles` (linije 106-130) — samo validacioni deo:

U `handleFiles`, zameni:
```js
        const allowed =
          file.type.startsWith("image/") || file.type === "application/pdf";
```
sa:
```js
        const ext =
          file.name.slice(file.name.lastIndexOf(".")).toLowerCase();
        const allowed =
          file.type.startsWith("image/") ||
          file.type === "application/pdf" ||
          file.type ===
            "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document" ||
          file.type === "application/msword" ||
          file.type === "text/plain" ||
          ALLOWED_FILE_EXTENSIONS.includes(ext);
```

Zatim, posle validacije veličine, dodaj mapiranje ekstenzije u type:

```js
        // Derive attachment `type` from MIME when available; fall back to
        // extension when the browser doesn't report it.
        let uploadType;
        if (file.type.startsWith("image/")) {
          uploadType = "image";
        } else if (file.type === "application/pdf" || ext === ".pdf") {
          uploadType = "pdf";
        } else if (
          file.type ===
            "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document" ||
          file.type === "application/msword" ||
          ext === ".doc" ||
          ext === ".docx"
        ) {
          uploadType = "doc";
        } else if (ext === ".txt") {
          uploadType = "txt";
        } else {
          uploadType = "pdf"; // safe fallback
        }
```

I prosledi `uploadType` umesto `result.type` u `setPending`:

```js
        setPending((prev) => [...prev, { ...result, type: uploadType }]);
```

**(c)** Proširi `accept` atribut na `<input type="file">` (linija ~220):

```jsx
        <input
          ref={fileRef}
          type="file"
          accept="image/*,.pdf,.doc,.docx,.txt,application/pdf,application/msword,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document,text/plain"
          multiple
          onChange={handleFiles}
          className="hidden"
        />
```

